.","The company is burning through $59.8B of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 2.4% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insiders hold 50% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 101% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":1.0103784597218142},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.1) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Financial Services peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Widening credit spreads suggest growing stress in corporate debt markets","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Broad market in a downtrend, trading below its 200-day average","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Multiple macro indicators signal economic contraction","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_